LieAlgebraRepresentations -- Lie algebra representations and characters
***********************************************************************

Description
===========

This package implements finite-dimensional representations of
finite-dimensional complex semisimple Lie algebras and their characters.

This package is a major expansion and renaming of the package formerly known as
LieTypes.

Authors
=======

  * Dave Swinarski (see https://faculty.fordham.edu/dswinarski/ )
    <dswinarski@fordham.edu>
  * Paul Zinn-Justin (see http://blogs.unimelb.edu.au/paul-zinn-justin/ )
    <pzinn@unimelb.edu.au>

Certification a gold star
=========================

Version 0.5 of this package (under the name "LieTypes") was accepted for
publication in volume 8 (see https://msp.org/jsag/2018/8-1/ ) of The Journal of
Software for Algebra and Geometry (see https://msp.org/jsag/ ) on 2 August
2018, in the article Software for computing conformal block divisors on bar
M_0,n (see https://msp.org/jsag/2018/8-1/p08.xhtml ) (DOI:
10.2140/jsag.2018.8.81 (see https://doi.org/10.2140/jsag.2018.8.81 )). That
version can be obtained from the journal (see
https://msp.org/jsag/2018/8-1/jsag-v8-n1-x08-LieTypes.m2 ).

Version
=======

This documentation describes version 1.01 of LieAlgebraRepresentations,
released May 1, 2026.

