********************************************************

  * Operator: *note ==: (Macaulay2Doc)==,
  * Usage: 
        g == h
  * Inputs:
      * g, an instance of the type *note LieAlgebra: LieAlgebra,, 
      * h, an instance of the type *note LieAlgebra: LieAlgebra,, 
  * Outputs:
      * b, a *note Boolean value: (Macaulay2Doc)Boolean,, 

Description
===========

+------------------------------+
|i1 : g=simpleLieAlgebra("A",2)|
|                              |
|o1 = g                        |
|                              |
|o1 : simple LieAlgebra        |
+------------------------------+
|i2 : h=simpleLieAlgebra("A",2)|
|                              |
|o2 = g                        |
|                              |
|o2 : simple LieAlgebra        |
+------------------------------+
|i3 : g==h                     |
|                              |
|o3 = true                     |
+------------------------------+

When dealing with subalgebras, Lie algebras can be isomorphic but different:

+-----------------------------------------+
|i4 : g1=subLieAlgebra(g,{1}); describe g1|
|                                         |
|o5 = 𝔞                                   |
|      1                                  |
+-----------------------------------------+
|i6 : g2=subLieAlgebra(g,{2}); describe g2|
|                                         |
|o7 = 𝔞                                   |
|      1                                  |
+-----------------------------------------+
|i8 : g1==g2 -- false!                    |
|                                         |
|o8 = false                               |
+-----------------------------------------+

