new LieAlgebra from Matrix -- Define a Lie algebra from its Cartan matrix
*************************************************************************

Description
===========

new LieAlgebra from M

If M is a valid Cartan matrix, it will reorder if needed the rows/columns of M
to a standard form and then output the corresponding Lie algebra g.

+----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : M = matrix {{2, 0, -3, 0}, {0, 2, 0, -1}, {-1, 0, 2, 0}, {0, -1, 0, 2}}|
