|      3    3   1 1    1 1     1   1 2    2 1    2   1 3    3 1    3   2 1    |
|     ------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|                                                                             |
|                                                                             |
|     ------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|      h , 0, - x h  + h x  + x , - x h  + h x  - 2x , - x h  + h x  - x , h y|
|     1 2        1 2    2 1    1     2 2    2 2     2     3 2    2 3    3   2 |
|     ------------------------------------------------------------------------|
