uNminus -- computes the universal enveloping algebra of the Lie algebra $N^{-}$
*******************************************************************************

  * Usage: 
        uNminus(g)
  * Inputs:
      * LAB, an instance of the type *note LieAlgebraBasis: LieAlgebraBasis,, 
  * Outputs:
      * UNMinus, a *note quotient of a free algebra:
        (AssociativeAlgebras)FreeAlgebra / Ideal,,

Description
===========

Let $\mathfrak{g}$ be a Lie algebra, let $\Phi^{+}$ be a set of positive roots,
and let $N^{-}$ be the subalgebra spanned by the negative root vectors
$\mathfrak{g}_{-\alpha}$. Let $T(N^{-})$ be the tensor algebra on $N^{-}$. The
universal enveloping algebra $U(N^{-1})$ is the quotient of $T(N^{-})$ by the
two-sided ideal generated by all relations of the form $Y_1 Y_2 - Y_2 Y_1 -
[Y_1,Y_2]$.



We construct $T(N^{-})$ and $U(N^{-})$ using the *note AssociativeAlgebras:
(AssociativeAlgebras)Top, package. The generators of $T(N^{-})$ are the
negative root vectors in a Lie algebra basis of $\mathfrak{g}$. Let
$Y_1,\ldots,Y_n$ the negative root vectors. Then the term order on $T(N^{-})$
we use is degree lex with the variables ordered $Y_l,\ldots,Y_1$, so that the
basis used for the quotient $U(N^{-})$ consists of monomials of the form
$Y_1^{a_1}\cdots Y_l^{a_l}$.





In the following example, we express the monomial $Y_3 Y_2 Y_1$ in $U(N^{-})$
for $\mathfrak{g} = sl_3$. We have $Y_1 = E_{(2,1)}$, $Y_2 = E_{(3,2)}$ and
$Y_3 = E_{(3,1)}$. Thus $Y_2 Y_1 = Y_1 Y_2+Y_3$ and $Y_3 Y_1 = Y_1 Y_3$, so
that $Y_3 Y_2 Y_1 = Y_1 Y_2 Y_3+Y_3^2$.



+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : sl3 = simpleLieAlgebra("A",2)                                           |
|                                                                             |
|o1 = sl3                                                                     |
|                                                                             |
|o1 : simple LieAlgebra                                                       |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : S = uNminus(sl3)                                                        |
|Warning:  F4 Algorithm not available over current coefficient ring or        |
|Converting to Naive algorithm.                                               |
|                                                                             |
|o2 = S                                                                       |
|                                                                             |
|o2 : FreeAlgebraQuotient                                                     |
|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|inhomogeneous ideal.                                                         |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : U = first S                                                             |
|                                                                             |
|o3 = 0                                                                       |
|                                                                             |
|o3 : S                                                                       |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : Y_3 Y_2 Y_1                                                             |
|                                                                             |
|o4 = Y                                                                       |
|      2                                                                      |
|                                                                             |
|o4 : S                                                                       |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+

