|        2      2        2 2      2                                2          |
|     B B B  - B B B  + B B  - B B B  + 3B B B B  - B B B B  - 2B B B  +      |
|      1 5 6    2 6 8    2 7    2 3 9     2 3 4 8    2 3 5 7     2 4 7        |
|     ------------------------------------------------------------------------|
