+---------------------------------------------+
|i4 : L = GTrepresentationMatrices(V);        |
+---------------------------------------------+
|i5 : V=lieAlgebraRepresentation(V,LAB,L);    |
+---------------------------------------------+
|i6 : W = V**V;                               |
+---------------------------------------------+
|i7 : weightMuHighestWeightVectorsInW({1,1},W)|
